        "Edge-case logic verified via Node.js simulation: all no-op guards fire correctly when elements are absent; _patchHealthBadge singular/plural forms correct; _patchTimingInfo no-ops on null timing; compare-and-swap prevents unnecessary DOM mutations.",
        "Regression suite: 1229/1229 tests pass across 41 GUI test files including project-detail-runs.test.ts (43 tests) and client-rendering.test.ts (21 tests). Zero regressions."
      ],
